   "id": 531498,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A public opinion poll about an upcoming election asked respondents, “How many political advertisements do you recall seeing on television in the last 24 hours?” The responses were as follows\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Create a frequency distribution for these data.</p>\n",
